<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tonight We Sing (film; sung by Ezio Pinza)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1953</span><span class="sg-chain-h">performed in the film and on its soundtrack album</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tetris (Atari)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1988</span><span class="sg-chain-h">theme music</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Darling and Doosri Darling, in 7 Khoon Maaf</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2011</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover with its own Hindi words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Payday 2 (video game)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2013</span><span class="sg-chain-h">sung by a character</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege (video game)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2015</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in a character's introductory video</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Civilization VI (video game)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2016</span><span class="sg-chain-h">theme of the Russian civilisation, arranged in layers for each era</span></li></ul></section>
